    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{7}{40}\\text{ kg}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{9}{10}-\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{3}{5}&=\\frac{36}{40}-\\frac{5}{40}-\\frac{24}{40}\\\\\\frac{9}{10}-\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{3}{5}&=\\frac{36-5-24}{40}\\\\\\frac{9}{10}-\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{3}{5}&=\\frac{7}{40}\\end{align*}$$\nThere was $\\frac{7}{40}\\text{ kg}$ of sugar left in the bag.",
